            "content": "{\"original_question\":\"I'm planning a weekend getaway and want to try something creatively fulfilling. What would you suggest?\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"What are the user's past creative hobbies, interests, or experiences that they have mentioned or engaged in?\",\"output_slot\":\"creative_history\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[],\"execution\":\"retrieval\"},\"grounded_subquestion\":\"What are the user's past creative hobbies, interests, or experiences that they have mentioned or engaged in?\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"deac1cbad67daa1c9b54736cf92d1e19c6c474ab617df6b3253223b8fd3729cc\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"f92f4e2229708f5444c4f521660f02f25fb95ccd606ad0a253d55ed5f2a5b6c1\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"a235a4199fe6e79fce9a038d3ca8d262e2101cd33208169057d6781729134f59\"},\"variables\":{\"creative_history\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"creative_history\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"creative_history\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"creative_history\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[{\"id\":\"fact_a9afa380579aa89195b87a64\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has a past creative hobby of music production and digital art, specifically digital remixing, which they engaged in around 2010. They later took a hiatus from remixing to focus on original compositions and personal projects, aiming to develop their unique sound. They also explored historical music trends in 2020 but found it tedious and uninspiring. They have expressed interest in engaging with music through attending live performances, discovering album artwork and lyrics, and creating playlists. They tried board games but found them unengaging.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s11\",\"s4\",\"s44\",\"s27\",\"s24\",\"s12\",\"s25\",\"s15\",\"s43\",\"s14\",\"s35\",\"s23\",\"s3\",\"s36\",\"s26\",\"s13\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user describes past creative experiences: music production/digital remixing around 2010 (s3, s4), a hiatus from remixing to focus on original compositions (s23, s24, s25, s26, s27), researching historical music trends in 2020 (s11, s12, s13), and other music engagement like attending live performances and creating playlists (s14, s15). They also mention trying board games but not finding them engaging (s35, s36), and losing interest in music theory (s43, s44). These are all past creative hobbies, interests, or experiences.\",\"variable\":\"creative_history\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\",\"superseded_by\":[\"fact_5695de2c82bc820d71fd414a\"]},{\"id\":\"fact_5695de2c82bc820d71fd414a\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has a past creative hobby of music production and digital art, specifically digital remixing, which they engaged in around 2010. They later took a hiatus from remixing to focus on original compositions and personal projects, aiming to develop their unique sound. They also explored historical music trends in 2020 but found it tedious and uninspiring. They have expressed interest in engaging with music through attending live performances, discovering album artwork and lyrics, and creating playlists. They tried board games but found them unengaging. They launched a podcast discussing the fusion of traditional and electronic music. They attended a hands-on workshop and enrolled in an audio production workshop. They are focusing on blending traditional musical roots with modern sounds and developing an app to help others do the same. They explored audio production techniques but found them unfulfilling, preferring to focus on creating their own tracks.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s11\",\"s4\",\"s100\",\"s44\",\"s72\",\"s60\",\"s99\",\"s69\",\"s27\",\"s24\",\"s111\",\"s12\",\"s25\",\"s15\",\"s43\",\"s61\",\"s14\",\"s71\",\"s59\",\"s62\",\"s35\",\"s23\",\"s112\",\"s98\",\"s113\",\"s3\",\"s36\",\"s110\",\"s70\",\"s26\",\"s13\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user describes past creative experiences: music production/digital remixing around 2010 (s3, s4), a hiatus from remixing to focus on original compositions (s23, s24, s25, s26, s27), researching historical music trends in 2020 (s11, s12, s13), other music engagement like attending live performances and creating playlists (s14, s15), trying board games but not finding them engaging (s35, s36), losing interest in music theory (s43, s44), launching a podcast (s59, s60, s61, s62), attending a workshop and enrolling in audio production (s69, s70, s71, s72), blending traditional roots with modern sounds and developing an app (s98, s99, s100), and exploring audio production techniques but finding them unfulfilling, preferring to create own tracks (s110, s111, s112, s113). These are all past creative hobbies, interests, or experiences.\",\"summary_revision\":{\"supersedes_route_ids\":[\"fact_a9afa380579aa89195b87a64\"],\"previous_version\":1,\"reason\":\"Incorporating additional sourced historical evidence from new documents (d7, d8, d11, d12) that describe the user's podcast, workshop enrollment, app development project, and preference for creating own tracks, while retaining all previously cited original sources and factual content.\"},\"variable\":\"creative_history\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",103,370,\"User: That was back in 2010. I remember feeling really excited about the whole process. It was such a wave of creativity! I still think about those late nights spent tweaking sounds and layering beats, capturing the essence of what I wanted to express through music. \",\"user\",[3]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",370,611,\"The thrill of sharing those creations with others is something I cherish deeply, as it fostered a sense of community among my friends. Looking back, it feels like a pivotal moment that sparked my passion for music production and digital art.\",\"user\",[3]],[\"s11\",\"d2\",105,393,\"User: It was something I tried in 2020, but researching historical music trends felt tedious and uninspiring. Despite my initial enthusiasm, diving into the vast amounts of literature, videos, and academic papers often felt overwhelming, almost like searching for a needle in a haystack. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s12\",\"d2\",393,638,\"The more I tried to pinpoint what fascinated me, the more daunting it became, complicating the pursuit of enjoyable learning. Perhaps due to this overload of information, I lost sight of what initially drew me to the subject in the first place. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s13\",\"d2\",638,828,\"It made me realize that sometimes a less structured approach to exploration could be more fulfilling, allowing for genuine interest to emerge rather than adhering strictly to a curriculum.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s14\",\"d2\",828,1224,\"User: I realized that there are so many other ways for me to engage with music that align more with my interests, such as diving deeper into different genres or exploring the cultural significance behind various musical styles. Additionally, I've found that attending live performances, whether they are concerts or smaller gigs, allows me to truly feel the energy and connection with the music. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s15\",\"d2\",1224,1624,\"Moreover, there's something special about discovering album artwork, lyrics, and the stories behind the songs that really captivates my curiosity. I've also considered making playlists that reflect different moods or themes, which can create a unique listening experience each time. The journey through music feels more personal and fulfilling when I can connect it to my own life story and emotions.\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s23\",\"d3\",107,413,\"User: I announced a hiatus from remixing to concentrate on original compositions and personal projects because I felt the remixes were overshadowing my own work. This decision was not made lightly, as I enjoyed the creative process of remixing and the way it allowed me to experiment with existing pieces. \",\"user\",[128,129]],[\"s24\",\"d3\",413,797,\"However, as I delved deeper into my own musical identity, I realized that I need to carve out space for my voice to shine through in original compositions. Taking this time off is about redefining my artistic vision and ensuring that my personal projects receive the attention they deserve. Ultimately, I hope to return with fresh ideas and a clearer focus on who I am as an artist.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[128,129]],[\"s25\",\"d3\",797,1102,\"User: I'm committing to invest my time in the creation of original music, focusing on my unique sound rather than merely reinterpreting the pieces of other artists. This decision comes from a deep-rooted desire to express my thoughts and feelings in ways that truly resonate with my personal experiences. \",\"user\",[128,129]],[\"s26\",\"d3\",1102,1392,\"I've come to understand that original compositions allow for a more authentic exploration of my artistic vision. It's an exciting challenge for me, as I embark on this journey of self-discovery through sound and melody, ultimately aiming for a sense of fulfillment in my creative pursuits. \",\"user\",[128,129]],[\"s27\",\"d3\",1392,1515,\"I hope to not only develop my skills but also share my passion with the world in a way that reflects who I am as an artist.\",\"user\",[128,129]],[\"s35\",\"d4\",107,504,\"User: I also played board games at a friend’s house. It was an experience that, while social, ultimately didn't engage me in the way I hoped. The atmosphere was quite lively, with everyone laughing and enjoying themselves, yet I found my attention drifting elsewhere. Perhaps it was the type of games we played or maybe I was just not in the mood for that kind of activity on that particular day. \",\"user\",[171]],[\"s36\",\"d4\",504,648,\"Sometimes, despite being surrounded by friends, you can feel a disconnect, as if you're merely an observer rather than a participant in the fun.\",\"user\",[171]],[\"s43\",\"d5\",105,482,\"User: I just lost interest halfway through and felt it was taking away the joy I find in music. There was a time when the thrill of discovering new melodies brought so much happiness, but diving too deep into the technical aspects became more of a chore. It’s curious how something that once brought joy can evolve into a source of stress when we start dissecting it too much. \",\"user\",[24]],[\"s44\",\"d5\",482,767,\"I remember the initial excitement of exploring different genres, each bringing a fresh perspective, but I struggled with the framework of music theory. Ultimately, I recognized that the essence of my love for music lay in its emotional connection rather than its analytical components.\",\"user\",[24]],[\"s59\",\"d6\",105,447,\"User: Yes! I launched a podcast discussing the fusion of traditional and electronic music. This platform has allowed me to reach a wider audience and share my experiences authentically. By interviewing artists and enthusiasts, I can dive deep into their creative processes and discover how they incorporate various elements into their music. \",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s60\",\"d6\",447,817,\"The feedback I’ve received has been overwhelmingly positive, with listeners appreciating the insights and stories shared. I also love being able to explore not just the music itself, but the cultural contexts that shape these genres and influence artists worldwide.\\n\\nUser: I realized that sharing my experiences could inspire others and even reignite my own creativity. \",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s61\",\"d6\",817,1128,\"The process of putting my thoughts into words has helped clarify my own perspective. It’s surprising how reflecting on past experiences can lead to deeper insights about one’s journey. Additionally, I’ve noticed that when I articulate my thoughts, it motivates me to think critically about my creative process. \",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s62\",\"d6\",1128,1266,\"This paradigm shift has not only invigorated my passion for music but also allowed me to connect with others who share similar sentiments.\",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s69\",\"d7\",105,388,\"User: Absolutely! After attending a hands-on workshop focused on integrating traditional sounds with digital techniques, I’m now enrolled in an audio production workshop. The workshop was eye-opening, providing insights into how to use technology to enhance traditional music forms. \",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s70\",\"d7\",388,780,\"I’m excited about the audio production course because it promises to deepen my technical knowledge and skills, especially in mixing and mastering. This new set of skills will allow me to bring my creative vision to life in ways I never thought possible. I truly believe that this journey will not only elevate my music but also connect me more deeply with the traditions I'm learning about.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s71\",\"d7\",780,1127,\"User: I found the practical aspects very exciting and relevant to my projects. Engaging in hands-on activities allows me to not only enhance my skills but also gain the confidence to experiment with different methods. It's invigorating to immerse myself in a learning environment where I can translate my imaginative ideas into tangible outcomes. \",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s72\",\"d7\",1127,1386,\"This experience feels entirely different from the theoretical coursework, as it truly brings the subject to life. I believe this grounding in practical techniques will significantly impact my overall creative journey and foster a deeper connection to my work.\",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s98\",\"d8\",105,408,\"User: Now, I’m focusing on blending my traditional musical roots with modern sounds and developing an app that helps others do the same. This exciting endeavor allows me to explore the rich heritage of my musical upbringing while also embracing contemporary genres that resonate with today's audiences. \",\"user\",[45]],[\"s99\",\"d8\",408,640,\"By experimenting with various elements, such as instrumentation and digital production techniques, I am able to create a unique sound that pays homage to my roots while also pushing the boundaries of what is traditionally expected. \",\"user\",[45]],[\"s100\",\"d8\",640,1002,\"Additionally, this app I am developing aims not only to assist me but also to empower others who share similar aspirations by providing tools, tutorials, and resources that inspire creativity. I believe that by combining our musical histories with modern technology, we can create something truly transformative, both personally and in the wider music community.\",\"user\",[45]],[\"s110\",\"d9\",105,430,\"User: I explored audio production techniques, but it just didn’t resonate with me, and I found myself tangled in technical details rather than embracing the creativity. I realized that while understanding the mechanics of sound is important, my true passion seems to lie more in experiencing music rather than dissecting it. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s111\",\"d9\",430,749,\"Despite my attempts to immerse myself in the production process, I came to feel it was more of a chore and less of the rewarding experience I had initially anticipated. I think I am more drawn to the emotional aspects of music, like the storytelling elements in lyrics or the feelings evoked by melodies and harmonies. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s112\",\"d9\",749,1006,\"Perhaps, I should focus my energy on areas that allow me to connect with music on a more emotional level.\\n\\nUser: It genuinely feels much better to focus on what truly inspires me, such as creating my own tracks, which bring me immense joy and satisfaction. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s113\",\"d9\",1006,1339,\"This process of creation allows me to express emotions and ideas that words sometimes fail to capture, acting as an outlet for my inner thoughts and feelings. Additionally, I find that crafting my own music provides me with a sense of accomplishment and personal growth, which is invaluable in a world often filled with uncertainty. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s114\",\"d9\",1339,1686,\"Music has a way of resonating with my soul, and every track I create becomes a piece of my identity and a reflection of my experiences. In contrast, when I watched a music documentary, it felt like something was missing, as it didn’t engage me in the way I had hoped, failing to evoke that same deep connection I feel when I compose my own pieces.\",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s115\",\"d9\",1686,1699,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s116\",\"d9\",1699,2074,\"Assistant: I completely understand where you're coming from, as focusing on your personal inspirations can lead to much more fulfilling creative experiences. When you channel your energy into producing music that resonates with you, it sets the stage for a more meaningful artistic journey, one where every note and beat are imbued with your unique perspective and emotions. \",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s117\",\"d9\",2074,2413,\"The importance of self-expression through music cannot be overstated; it serves not only as a form of art but also as a therapeutic outlet. The reason documentaries can sometimes feel lacking is that they often offer an external perspective, stripping away the intimate connection that comes from creating something personally meaningful. \",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s118\",\"d9\",2413,2670,\"While documentaries can provide insights and inspiration, they may not have the same emotional weight as hearing your own creations come to life, as they can't replicate the enriching experience of your own artistic journey and how it unfolds in real time. \",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s119\",\"d9\",2670,2896,\"It's essential to honor that desire to create authentically, for it's in those moments of genuine expression that true artistry emerges, transforming mere sounds into something transcendent that can touch the hearts of others.\",\"assistant\",[42]]],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"personal_response_selection\":true,\"phase\":\"history_evidence\",\"summary_revision_contracts\":{\"creative_history\":{\"previous_version\":2,\"eligible_route_ids\":[\"fact_5695de2c82bc820d71fd414a\"],\"required_source_ids\":[\"s11\",\"s4\",\"s100\",\"s44\",\"s72\",\"s60\",\"s99\",\"s69\",\"s27\",\"s24\",\"s111\",\"s12\",\"s25\",\"s15\",\"s43\",\"s61\",\"s14\",\"s71\",\"s59\",\"s62\",\"s35\",\"s23\",\"s112\",\"s98\",\"s113\",\"s3\",\"s36\",\"s110\",\"s70\",\"s26\",\"s13\"]}},\"source_documents\":{\"d1\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:8d651d67302461242ef90e679d7982f6660c139cfc008cc0a0793d4a9a93f800\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":3.0,\"observed_end\":4.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d2\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:e4d616196a07ea70854e695e19b8c0e3f4edd8dc0883539941c99c997a1a5a3c\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":37.0,\"observed_end\":39.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d3\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:dec3472e053d202dcd3cd3a9ab730cba91ae9b38d5a120db5c35075af3276352\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":128.0,\"observed_end\":130.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d4\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:95dba8bf7bd579cd3644647271786292f39ef96b74ad37df15f27b2daddc5cb9\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":171.0